### Worked example: issue an upper-secondary diploma
POST https://sandbox.igrant.io/v2/issuer/credential-offer
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "learnerUlid": "ULID-01HZY3T8Q4R7WXKM",
  "credentialType": "DiplomaCredential",
  "claims": {
    "ulid": "ULID-01HZY3T8Q4R7WXKM",
    "name": "Amina Okafor",
    "dateOfBirth": "2007-03-14",
    "achievement": {
      "name": "Upper Secondary School Diploma",
      "awardingInstitution": "Lakeside Secondary School",
      "qualificationCode": "NQF-4-GEN",
      "grade": "Distinction",
      "awardedOn": "2026-06-12"
    }
  }
}

### Expected 201 response
{
  "offerId": "offer_9f31c2",
  "credentialOfferUri": "openid-credential-offer://?credential_offer_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fsandbox.igrant.io%2Fv2%2Foffers%2Foffer_9f31c2",
  "qrCodePayload": "openid-credential-offer://?credential_offer_uri=...",
  "expiresAt": "2026-06-12T12:00:00Z"
}
